{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>【Now新聞台】筲箕灣凌晨有單位起火，約300人需要疏散，一名男子受傷送院。</p>\n<p>警方及消防員到場，協助約三百名居民疏散到地下。凌晨一時許，愛蝶灣4座一個單位起火，消防員接報到場開喉灌救，約20分鐘後將火救熄，一名75歲男子多處輕微燒傷清醒送院。</p>\n<p>消防初步調查後懷疑是電器短路引致火警。</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T23:44:24.893967+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":141,"images":0,"source":"Now 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T23:20:04+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T23:37:52.642585+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T23:37:52.642585+00:00","content_hash":"fec1e112cfa7b3767c840109c5a19f3a3a5059d70b46b1f17e064862d976b5ba","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}